5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To ensure our expansion is sustainable, I believe we must first understand the external factors that impact our reliability. I will examine the winter road closures north of the river and the quoted delivery windows from suppliers.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm so happy to be part of this! I want to make sure everyone can actually get to the library, so I'll look into the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure we have a stable foundation for the future, I shall examine the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"Hello everyone! I'm so excited to dive into this with you. To make sure we aren't just guessing, I'll look into the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello. I think it's important to know if we have enough help. I'll look into the volunteer register and supervision training, and the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I believe we have a comprehensive set of priorities. By examining both the financial constraints and the physical accessibility of our network, we can avoid the pitfalls of an overly optimistic plan. I am satisfied with our selections.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I totally agree, Ryuji! It feels like we're covering everything from the money to the roads and the people. I'm just so excited to see what we find out! Let's do our best for the community!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"I agree. A balanced approach is the most reliable way to proceed. By looking at the structural and financial records, we can ensure that our ambitions are grounded in reality. I look forward to the findings.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I'm with you all! It's a great mix of perspectives. I just have a feeling that the secrets to our future success are hiding in the things we've already tried. Can't wait to see the results!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I hope the information helps us make a good choice. I'll just wait for the results now.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Since we have all declared our areas of investigation and agreed on the breadth of our approach, I believe further deliberation at this stage is unnecessary. I am ready to review the findings.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Me too! I'm all set and ready to go! I can't wait to see what the data tells us about how people are using the library. Let's see what we find!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I concur. We have a clear division of labor and a comprehensive set of data to analyze. I am ready to proceed to the findings.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm ready too! Let's stop talking and start digging. I have a feeling the archives are going to be much more interesting than we expect. See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm ready too... I'll just wait for the findings.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
20,1,3,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We have established a logical framework for our investigation. I shall await the data with a measured expectation.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm all ready too! I'll be waiting with a big smile! Let's hope we find some wonderful ways to help more people. See you all soon!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,George,,I agree. We have a solid plan in place. I shall await the results of our research with a calm mind.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
