27,1,4,talk,May,,I'm already counting down the minutes! Let's hope the records are as juicy as I think they'll be. See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
